  "criterion": "When `.changeset/config.json` is a JSON object, init translates `fixed` into `[[fixed-group]]` entries named `fixed-<n>`, with each member pattern of a group that uses only names, `*` and `?` matched as a glob against npm package names (a package's npm name, whatever its primary id) and written as the packages that exist now. A group with a `!`, `{`, `[` or `(` in any pattern is not written: its warning names the group and carries the `[[fixed-group]]` block, with today's members, to paste after review. Init also generates the workflow's branch filter from `baseBranch` in place of the detected default branch. Every other key it does not carry over (`linked`, `ignore`, `updateInternalDependencies`, `changelog`, `commit` and any unknown key, but not `$schema`, and not an empty `fixed`, `linked` or `ignore`) gets one `changesets-config-key-dropped` warning diagnostic naming the key. The `fixed` warning says packages created later must be added by hand and names each pattern that matched no npm package. The `linked` warning says callisto bumps every member of a linked group. With `--versioning fixed` the translated groups are dropped and a warning says so. A `baseBranch` with no generated workflow gets a warning."
},
{
